  <p id="c-liangshu-035-wanglingbin-elegist:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-035-wanglingbin-elegist:p001:m0000" ref="ijh_3fs_6u2_A">蕭子恪</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-035-wanglingbin-elegist:p001:m0005" ref="ijh_3fs_6u2_A">景沖</persName>，蘭陵人，齊豫章文獻王<persName id="c-liangshu-035-wanglingbin-elegist:p001:m0018" ref="ijh_3fs_6u2">嶷</persName>第二子也。</p>
